# =================================
# Equals test
# Example from Patrick Hochstenbach
# =================================
# Companion to equals-same-as.srl (equals.n3 already ports this same
# .srl's own).

@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix : <http://example.org/socrates#>.

:X = :Y .

{ :X owl:sameAs :Y } => { :test :is true }.
